### Step-7.6 Configure ansible.cfg

```bash
vi ansible.cfg
```

Content:

```ini
[defaults]

inventory = inventory

host_key_checking = False

remote_user = ec2-user

private_key_file = /home/ec2-user/id_rsa
```

Verify:

```bash
cat ansible.cfg
```

Output:

```text
[defaults]

inventory = inventory

host_key_checking = False

remote_user = ec2-user

private_key_file = /home/ec2-user/id_rsa
